    ✔ Keep the serialized selected-filter shape as ordered {id, direction} entries for preset compatibility. @done(26-07-12)
    ✔ Update module registration and lifecycle cache-reset contracts for each new production module. @done(26-07-12; candidate_provider is stateless and needs no reset hook)
