        ☐ Open SoulSearch with defaults and confirm humanoids appear while pets/livestock do not.
        ☐ Include Trainable Animals and confirm eligible animals appear without changing humanoid ranking order.
        ☐ Exclude Dwarves from Humanoids and confirm other matching humanoids remain.
        ☐ Search specifically for Dogs and confirm dog units can be selected and zoomed to.
        ☐ Verify unnamed animals and units without souls display without errors.
        ☐ Verify compound ordering, individual-race alphabetical ordering, picker search, keyboard navigation, mouse actions, and close behavior.
        ☐ Clear all filters and confirm the state resets to include Humanoids.
        ☐ Save and reload a mixed race/ranking preset and confirm membership, exclusions, and ranking order survive.
        ☐ Close and reopen the window and confirm persisted filter state and result behavior.
        ☐ Reload edited modules and repeat one humanoid and one animal search without stale catalog data.
    Closure
        ☐ Record automated command results and live observations in this document.
        ☐ Mark the Add race filters item complete in docs/project.todo only after every required gate above passes.

Implementation notes
    ☐ Treat this document as the source of truth for phase order and completion state.
    ☐ Do not mark live DFHack checks complete from automated tests or code inspection alone.
    ☐ Stop at a failed phase gate, record the failure, and fix it before beginning the next phase.
    ☐ Preserve unrelated user changes in the working tree throughout implementation.
